### Creative Content

The dialogue scripts, lore, deity names (Amansinaya, Haik, Neguno, Manunubo, Bakunawa), and all narrative content in this project reference Philippine mythology and cultural heritage. These references are used respectfully for educational purposes. The game's educational content about marine biology and Philippine marine ecosystems is based on publicly available research.

The 3D models, textures, audio, and artwork created specifically for this project remain the copyright of their respective creators on the team.

